### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 04 — ALL SIX AGENT ROLES
###
### ArcClaw ships six persona-based agents. Each has a distinct
### system prompt, tool schema, and maxIterations constraint.
###
### Role → Deity       → Tools available
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### coordinator → Vishnu    → github, scheduletask, manageschedule, memory_search
### researcher  → Saraswati → github, memory_search
### coder       → Brahma    → NONE (empty schema — by design)
### debugger    → Shiva     → github only
### architect   → Brihaspati→ github, memory_search
### synthesizer → Dattatreya→ github, scheduletask, manageschedule, memory_search
###
### Hindu deity aliases also work (e.g. agentRole: "vishnu", "brahma", "shiva")
###
### NOTE: coder + debugger have an intentionally EMPTY tool schema.
###       They cannot trigger tool calls regardless of prompt content.
###       This is a structural guarantee, not just a system-prompt rule.
###
### Prerequisites: ArcClaw serve mode, GROQ_API_KEY set
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl  = http://localhost:8080
@validKey = key-internal-changeme

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# COORDINATOR — Vishnu (orchestrator, delegation, scheduling)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROLE-1] Create session for coordinator
# @name coordSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ROLE-2] Coordinator: task decomposition (no tools needed)
# Expect 200 Finished: Vishnu's synthesized answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{coordSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Explain what a ReAct agent loop is in exactly 2 sentences.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{coordSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RESEARCHER — Saraswati (facts, knowledge retrieval)
# Strict rule: never fabricates, only cites what it knows.
# Has access to github + memory_search tools.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROLE-3] Create session for researcher
# @name researchSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ROLE-4] Researcher: knowledge question (no external tool needed)
# Expect 200 Finished: fact-based answer from Saraswati
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{researchSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is the difference between AES-GCM and AES-GCM-SIV encryption modes?",
    "agentRole": "researcher",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{researchSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CODER — Brahma (code generation, math, logic)
# Empty tool schema — structurally cannot make any tool calls.
# Will refuse conversational/non-technical requests.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROLE-5] Create session for coder
# @name coderSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ROLE-6] Coder: pure code generation (no tools needed — empty schema)
# Expect 200 Finished: Java code from Brahma
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{coderSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Write a Java 21 method that takes a list of integers and returns the top 3 distinct values in descending order using streams.",
    "agentRole": "coder",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

### [ROLE-7] Coder: Brahma alias works identically
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{coderSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is Big-O complexity of QuickSort in the average case? Show the proof.",
    "agentRole": "brahma",
    "maxIterations": 2
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{coderSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEBUGGER — Shiva (bug analysis, stack traces, security audits)
# Contrarian persona — will challenge assumptions and surface blind spots.
# Has github tool (read-only operations only).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROLE-8] Create session for debugger
# @name debugSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ROLE-9] Debugger: analyze a stack trace
# Expect 200 Finished: root cause analysis from Shiva
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{debugSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Analyze this stack trace and identify the root cause:\njava.lang.NullPointerException: Cannot invoke method on null object\n  at com.example.UserService.getUser(UserService.java:42)\n  at com.example.UserController.handleRequest(UserController.java:18)",
    "agentRole": "debugger",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{debugSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ARCHITECT — Brihaspati (system design, ADRs, trade-off analysis)
# Will NOT write production code — delegates that back to Brahma.
# Has github + memory_search tools for reviewing existing code/context.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROLE-10] Create session for architect
# @name archSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ROLE-11] Architect: design trade-off analysis
# Expect 200 Finished: Brihaspati's architectural assessment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{archSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Evaluate the architectural trade-offs of using SQLite WAL mode vs PostgreSQL for an agentic AI kernel that handles hundreds of concurrent sessions. Consider latency, portability, and ACID guarantees.",
    "agentRole": "architect",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{archSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SYNTHESIZER — Dattatreya (cross-domain: code + debug + research + arch)
# The Trinity Incarnate. Only activate when ONE task genuinely spans
# multiple specialist domains simultaneously.
# Has all tools: github, scheduletask, manageschedule, memory_search.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROLE-12] Create session for synthesizer
# @name synthSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ROLE-13] Synthesizer: cross-domain task
# Expect 200 Finished: integrated analysis from Dattatreya
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{synthSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "A Java service is experiencing high memory under load. Diagnose whether the root cause is a code defect (Brahma's domain), a design flaw (Brihaspati's domain), or a known JVM behavior (Saraswati's domain). Synthesize a unified recommendation.",
    "agentRole": "synthesizer",
    "maxIterations": 4
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{synthSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ROLE ALIAS VALIDATION
# AgentRoleEnum.fromString() accepts both canonical names and deity aliases.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROLE-14] Verify all deity aliases resolve correctly
# @name aliasSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### "vishnu" alias → coordinator persona
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{aliasSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Say: I am Vishnu, the Coordinator.",
    "agentRole": "vishnu",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### "saraswati" alias → researcher persona
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{aliasSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Say: I am Saraswati, the Researcher.",
    "agentRole": "saraswati",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### "shiva" alias → debugger persona
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{aliasSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Say: I am Shiva, the Debugger.",
    "agentRole": "shiva",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### "dattatreya" alias → synthesizer persona
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{aliasSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Say: I am Dattatreya, the Synthesizer.",
    "agentRole": "dattatreya",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{aliasSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

